    "title": "Men's Nano Puff® Jacket",
    "description": "The Men's Patagonia Nano Puff Jacket is a packable, lightweight jacket designed for climbing and hiking in cold, wet weather. It features a 100% recycled polyester ripstop shell with a durable water repellent finish and is insulated with 60g PrimaLoft Gold Insulation Eco for warmth without bulk. The design includes brick quilting to stabilize insulation, a low-profile fit for layering, and a center-front zipper with a wicking storm flap. It is equipped with two zippered handwarmer pockets and an internal chest pocket that doubles as a stuff sack. This jacket is Fair Trade Certified and made from recycled materials.",
